<title>USA: Steel of W. Virginia says demand soft.</title>
<headline>Steel of W. Virginia says demand soft.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTINGTON, W. Va. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steel of West Virginia Inc said on Friday that the market demand for its products remain soft.</p>
<p>The company said it does not expect any improvement in the near future.</p>
<p>Steel of West Virginia said it has developed a new modernization program to upgrade its equipment, and plans to move into the manufactured housing market.</p>
<p>-- ((New York Newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
